# Memory Index

Curated retrieval map for cross-ticket continuity.

## How to Use

- Add links to reusable memory pages by domain/module.
- Keep entries short; link to sources instead of duplicating long narratives.
- Update after merge when a ticket yields durable insights.
- Write decision records only when the choice is hard to reverse, surprising without context, and the result of a real trade-off.

## Domains

### [Domain Name]
- Concept: [Title](concepts/example-concept.md)
- Decision: [Title](decisions/example-decision.md)
- Source tickets: ../../tickets/PROJ-0001-example.md

### [Another Domain]
- Concept: ...
- Decision: ...

## Maintenance Checklist

- Mark superseded decisions and update index links; never delete decision records.
- Add missing links for high-frequency issue areas.
- Keep this page skimmable.
